# Auto-run requested work

When the user has asked to implement, complete, or push work without asking them to Run or Allow:

1. Do not stop to ask the user to run a command or approve a step in chat.
2. If Auto-review blocks a Shell command, immediately retry the exact same command with `request_smart_mode_approval` set to true and the exact block reason. Do not rewrite the command.
3. Continue through changelog, validate, commit, and `git push` when they asked to push to GitHub.
